# Worms of the Earth's upkeep trigger: "any player may sacrifice two lands of their choice or have this enchantment deal 5
# damage to that player. If a player does either, destroy this enchantment." Each player chooses in turn order from the
# active player (CR 101.4). Bot1 plays a Swamp on turn 1 and an Island on turn 3, before casting the Worms; Bot2 plays an
# Island and casts a Mox Jet on turn 2. At Bot2's upkeep on turn 4 Bot2 chooses first: with one land (and a Mox, no land)
# it isn't offered to sacrifice two (CR 101.2), and takes neither; Bot1, the Worms' controller, with exactly two lands,
# sacrifices both (CR 701.21a), and the Worms is destroyed (CR 701.8a). No one is dealt damage.

